  = note: required for `UInt<UInt<UInt<UInt<UTerm, B1>, B0>, B0>, B1>` to implement `FitsBits<u8>`
  = note: required for `Uint<UInt<UInt<UInt<UInt<UTerm, B1>, B0>, B0>, B1>, u8>` to implement `Hash`
